  "title": "Daraxonrasib Demonstrates Superiority Over Chemotherapy in Metastatic Pancreatic Adenocarcinoma",
  "summary": "In the phase 3 RASolute 302 study presented at ASCO 2026, the RAS(ON) inhibitor daraxonrasib nearly doubled median overall survival versus chemotherapy (13.2 vs 6.6 months) in previously treated metastatic pancreatic cancer, with far fewer treatment discontinuations.",
